# Allowlist-form ignore file for docker/companion.Dockerfile (containerized-dev-env, design D9).
# A per-Dockerfile ignore file REPLACES the root .dockerignore, so this one must be complete on
# its own: deny everything, allow only what the module stage copies, then re-exclude build
# output and secrets that may sit inside the allowed trees.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!companion/**
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/pkg
**/*.tgz
**/.env*
